        "content": "The file /home/runner/work/agentdaily/agentdaily/updates/2026-08-13/index.html has been updated. Here's the result of running `cat -n` on a snippet of the edited file:\n     1→<!DOCTYPE html>\n     2→<html lang=\"en\">\n     3→<head>\n     4→    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n     5→    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n     6→    <title>Agentic Coding Research Report - 2026-08-13</title>\n     7→    <style>\n     8→        * {\n     9→            margin: 0;\n    10→            padding: 0;\n    11→            box-sizing: border-box;\n    12→        }\n    13→\n    14→        body {\n    15→            font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\n    16→            font-size: 13px;\n    17→            line-height: 1.4;\n    18→            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n    19→            color: #000000;\n    20→        }\n    21→\n    22→        .container {\n    23→            max-width: 1400px;\n    24→            margin: 0 auto;\n    25→            padding: 10px;\n    26→        }\n    27→\n    28→        /* Header Styles */\n    29→        header {\n    30→            background-color: #ff6600;\n    31→            padding: 8px 12px;\n    32→            margin-bottom: 15px;\n    33→        }\n    34→\n    35→        header h1 {\n    36→            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    37→            font-size: 16px;\n    38→            font-weight: bold;\n    39→            color: #000000;\n    40→        }\n    41→\n    42→        header .date {\n    43→            font-size: 12px;\n    44→            color: #000000;\n    45→            margin-top: 4px;\n    46→        }\n    47→\n    48→        /* Three Column Layout */\n    49→        .three-column-layout {\n    50→            display: grid;\n    51→            grid-template-columns: 40% 35% 25%;\n    52→            gap: 12px;\n    53→        }\n    54→\n    55→        @media (max-width: 1024px) {\n    56→            .three-column-layout {\n    57→  