          "-                    <h3><a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/#Aug. 7, 2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Moonlight & Mayhem (Raccoon Heist by Codex + GPT-5.6 Sol Ultra)</a></h3>",
